              "sha256": "df9b16c4bb759cca831267229886d3d7029e9165141ec8766da31a125cc5ade8",
              "quote": "匠人用拇指摸过自己认得的边，收进工具袋。"
            },
            "chapter": 5
          }
        ],
        "deadline_chapter": 7,
        "status": "closed",
        "last_reviewed_chapter": 5
      },
      "TH-SOUTH-BRIDGE": {
        "history": [
          {
            "id": "TH-SOUTH-BRIDGE",
            "action": "set",
            "deadline_chapter": 4,
            "reason": "湿冷来者已到场求借人，下一章须照护、核实与回应，不把声称货量算现有粮。",
            "evidence": {
              "chapter": 3,
              "sha256": "39b804805f5352bf8ef8732b8eb03ccb61452605e7bef2119c34dcffd27eacf3",
              "quote": "先问能不能借人，把车和牲口弄开。"
            },
            "chapter": 3
          },
          {
            "id": "TH-SOUTH-BRIDGE",
            "action": "complete",
            "deadline_chapter": 4,
            "reason": "来者先获照护，桥实勘、人畜及六安全袋实到堡，求借人目标完成；车货损失仍在。",
            "evidence": {
              "chapter": 4,
              "sha256": "bd13b07ed563d7bb0082215af35ceec19015f5dc387065b8bf1d10bbcce8d7fc",
              "quote": "伊恩等最后一袋落稳，才说：“人也到了。加柏勒，你们四个。”"
            },
            "chapter": 4
          }
        ],
        "deadline_chapter": 4,
        "status": "closed",
        "last_reviewed_chapter": 4
      },
      "TH-CITY-SLED-REPAIR": {
        "history": [
          {
            "id": "TH-CITY-SLED-REPAIR",
            "action": "set",
            "deadline_chapter": 7,
            "reason": "本章城橇横档断，CH005先查料并停用，至迟CH007给真实修复/改用途/有代价处理，不下一日凭空两好橇。",
            "evidence": {
              "chapter": 4,
              "sha256": "bd13b07ed563d7bb0082215af35ceec19015f5dc387065b8bf1d10bbcce8d7fc",
              "quote": "“明天不能照常用。”乌铎道，“得找合用木料。拆了这根再看里头。”"
            },
            "chapter": 4
          },
          {
            "id": "TH-CITY-SLED-REPAIR",
            "action": "complete",
            "deadline_chapter": 7,
            "reason": "原事项允许有代价改用途，车身已明确舍弃实拆，留滑木不报复车，单橇两趟有损失，不用新期限延原等待。",
            "evidence": {
              "chapter": 7,
              "sha256": "fe7865101ff15cefe516ca3a5ee3f821a2cba7f27f192594b3f25569fa0987d3",
              "quote": "原来坏橇停着的地方，只有两根留用滑木，旁边堆着不能当车的旧件。"
            },
            "chapter": 7
          }
        ],
        "deadline_chapter": 7,
        "status": "closed",
        "last_reviewed_chapter": 7
      },
      "TH-D5-REST": {
        "history": [
          {
            "id": "TH-D5-REST",
            "action": "set",
            "deadline_chapter": 6,
            "reason": "D3/D4已吐，D5整日无吐须CH006实际见证；当前十点只是开始，不解除持续三日限制。",
            "evidence": {
              "chapter": 5,
              "sha256": "df9b16c4bb759cca831267229886d3d7029e9165141ec8766da31a125cc5ade8",
              "quote": "眼前安静，不等于休息日已经过去。"
            },
            "chapter": 5
          },
          {
            "id": "TH-D5-REST",
            "action": "complete",
            "deadline_chapter": 6,
            "reason": "本章跨至D6六点，正文和对话均支持D5整日无深息，饭厅和西屋实用柴。",
            "evidence": {
              "chapter": 6,
              "sha256": "2629ddfea4ebc79be96d3e4298e6a464ead3657f731555a666c2bb9d710cd764",
              "quote": "旧石没接新火，赫穆昨夜没给任何地方补火。这个休息日过去了。"
            },
            "chapter": 6
          }
        ],
        "deadline_chapter": 6,
        "status": "closed",
        "last_reviewed_chapter": 6
      },
      "TH-FUEL-NEXT": {
        "history": [
          {
            "id": "TH-FUEL-NEXT",
            "action": "set",
            "deadline_chapter": 8,
            "reason": "库0、饭厅无未拆备用，补窗不是新增燃料，下章须落实当夜/次晨接柴真实来源与代价。",
            "evidence": {
              "chapter": 7,
              "sha256": "fe7865101ff15cefe516ca3a5ee3f821a2cba7f27f192594b3f25569fa0987d3",
              "quote": "可库里已是空的，明晨要送出去的新柴，并不在任何一处等着他。"
            },
            "chapter": 7
          },
          {
            "id": "TH-FUEL-NEXT",
            "action": "complete",
            "deadline_chapter": 8,
            "reason": "真实从0买入24，夜分4后原60/西8过夜，D7晨再分12，库余8，钱与搬工已付；只完成上一章本夜/明晨接柴的到期义务，后续燃料仍有限。",
            "evidence": {
              "chapter": 8,
              "sha256": "18af44bf255825110f08d03730af0459230b6206ae626d28c9f89bb7f61adaf0",
              "quote": "等八下钟声敲过，库内还有八捆。"
            },
            "chapter": 8
          }
        ],
        "deadline_chapter": 8,
        "status": "closed",
        "last_reviewed_chapter": 8
      }
    },
